st beta released 12 hours ago) works just fine on the server I run, but starting up the client leads to a crash just before getting to the main menu. I am sure it's probably not a issue with just jei alone as nobody else has reported anything yet, however I figure it's worth reporting in case it's a easy fix without a bug hunt.\r\n\r\nThanks! Have a great day!~","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/1189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/1189/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4040","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4040/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4040/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4040/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4040","id":3224667116,"node_id":"I_kwDOAXhAOc7ANIPs","number":4040,"title":"[Suggestion]: Update/port to new Minecraft versions and new mod loaders","user":{"login":"mezz","id":916092,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNjA5Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/916092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz","html_url":"https://github.com/mezz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mezz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":133867051,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzM4NjcwNTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"84b6eb","default":true,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":45,"created_at":"2025-07-12T02:01:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T13:40:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Suggestion\n\nPlease don't ask for updates. I don't check the Github issues when I'm working on a major version update, and it's adding extra work for me to go through and close these issues after.\n\nI've been updating this mod to the latest versions out of my own volition for nearly 10 years now; there is absolutely no purpose or benefit to requesting, complaining, pouting, or attempting to manipulate me in the issues to try to convince me it's needed.\n\nPlease never ask for mod authors to update their mods, and especially don't act entitled or hostile towards the people working hard on the things you enjoy. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n\n### Current Requirements for updates:\n\n#### NeoForge:\n- [x] https://github.com/neoforged/NeoForge/pull/2021\n- [x] Port the JEI code\n- [x] Publish to Curseforge and Modrinth\n\n#### Fabric 1.21.10:\n- [x] https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric/pull/4841\n- [x] https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric/issues/4667\n\t\t* ~~WIP Solution: https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric/pull/4878~~\n\t\t* New WIP Solution: https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric/pull/4926\n- [x] Port the JEI code\n- [x] https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/pull/4134\n- [x] Publish to Curseforge and Modrinth\n\n#### Fabric for other older versions than 1.21.10:\n* JEI requires Fabric 1.21.10 features to work. Please update to 1.21.10\n\n#### Forge:\n- [ ] Gradle improvements (including ForgeGradle in the multiproject currently requires workarounds and slowdowns)\n\t\t* https://github.com/MinecraftForge/ForgeGradle/issues/991\n\t\t* https://github.com/MinecraftForge/ForgeGradle/issues/992\n\t\t* https://github.com/MinecraftForge/ForgeGradle/issues/993\n\t\t* Likely more fixes are required but will need multiproject testing on the new ForgeGradle\n- [ ] Recipe Sync API from server to client\n- [ ] Port the JEI code\n- [ ] Publish to Curseforge and Modrinth","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4040/reactions","total_count":120,"+1":31,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":89,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4040/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4137","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4137/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4137/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4137/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4137","id":3581747588,"node_id":"I_kwDOAXhAOc7VfSGE","number":4137,"title":"[Bug]: JEI Doesn't Work When Entering Multiplayer Directly on First Launch of Fabric 1.21.10","user":{"login":"lelmc","id":63336730,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMzM2NzMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63336730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc","html_url":"https://github.com/lelmc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lelmc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":133867051,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzM4NjcwNTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"84b6eb","default":true,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":41,"created_at":"2025-11-03T11:59:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T01:07:55Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T14:24:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Steps to Reproduce the Bug\n\nLaunch Minecraft with the following versions: 1.21.10-Fabric 0.17.3 and fabric-api-0.137.0+1.21.10.\nAfter the game fully loads, do not enter single-player mode. Instead, directly access multiplayer mode.\nCheck if JEI functions normally in multiplayer mode.\nTo verify the workaround: Exit multiplayer mode, enter single-player mode, press E to open the inventory, then exit single-player and re-enter multiplayer mode to check JEI.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nFollowing the steps above, JEI should load and function normally immediately when entering multiplayer mode directly after launching the game. There should be no requirement to first enter single-player mode and open the inventory to activate JEI.\n\n### Actual Behavior\n\nWhen entering multiplayer mode directly after launching the game, JEI fails to load and does not work. It only starts functioning properly after first entering single-player mode, pressing E to open the inventory, and then re-entering multiplayer mode.\n\n### Mod Pack URL (Optional)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Mod Pack Version (Optional)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Extra Notes (Optional)\n\n_No response_\n\n### latest.log\n\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4137/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/4137/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2213","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2213/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2213/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2213/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2213","id":786478286,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3ODY0NzgyODY=","number":2213,"title":"JEI not showing on the right when booting and joining server, have to do /reload everytime when booting game","user":{"login":"zachsai","id":63996164,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTk2MTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63996164?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zachsai","html_url":"https://github.com/zachsai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zachsai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zachsai/following{/other_user}","gi