n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/63/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/63/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/649","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/649/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/649/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/649/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/649","id":193217358,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxOTMyMTczNTg=","number":649,"title":"Search bar; loss of focus / hang","user":{"login":"CMCarlsen","id":3077339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzczMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3077339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen","html_url":"https://github.com/CMCarlsen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CMCarlsen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":320817844,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjA4MTc4NDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/labels/other%20mod","name":"other mod","color":"bfe5bf","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":38,"created_at":"2016-12-02T21:03:46Z","updated_at":"2022-08-12T05:00:49Z","closed_at":"2016-12-10T21:33:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This event is kind of frustrating as I'm having difficulty reproducing it in a reliable manner. However, it affects both myself and others using the mod-pack. Here goes:\r\n\r\nAfter having typed something into JEI and wishing to erase it, some unknown event triggers (presumably a bad mod interaction?), and the search bar stops responding. The search box no longer takes input from the keyboard or mouse, and I have to close and re-open my inventory before it will take inputs again. If I right-click the search bar before triggering the event, it clears the entire bar, but then the event triggers and it stops taking input, requiring inventory window refresh.\r\n\r\nThings I know about the issue:\r\n- It stops deleting text at the last, or second to last, character. (e.g. \"banana\" stops at \"ba\" or \"b\")\r\n- I have to refresh my inventory window before I can finish deleting the text, and type my new query.\r\n- Right-click to clear will delete the entire bar, but it still won't allow input until after inventory refresh.\r\n- Once the issue occurs, text cannot be added either. It is stuck.\r\n- The error can occur in both single and multiplayer!\r\n\r\nThings I'm presuming:\r\n- Is caused by bad mod interaction with JEI, ~though I'm currently unsure which mod~ [SignPicture](https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sign-picture).\r\n- The issue seems to trigger after a set amount of time? Or possibly when exploring item recipes in JEI?\r\n\r\nThings I've tried / am trying:\r\n- ~Right-click to clear; causes error to trigger.~\r\n- ~If I quickly type and delete text, the issue doesn't seem to occur (at least not yet)~.\r\n- Seems to occur when hitting certain keys while searching in JEI.\r\n\r\nGeneral Info:\r\n- MC version: 1.10.2\r\n- Forge version: forge-12.18.3.2185\r\n- Has occurred in two different mod packs I've modified. One is the Direwolf pack, the other is the \"All The Mods\" pack. (However, I feel it important to note that I have **_heavily_** edited both mod packs. At the point the error occurred, they were more or less home-brew packs.)\r\n\r\nWill update this as I gain a better understanding.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/649/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2808","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2808/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2808/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2808/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/2808","id":1216028900,"node_id":"I_kwDOAXhAOc5IeyDk","number":2808,"title":"[Bug]: 1.18.2 JEI not showing crafting recipes after updating mods in a server","user":{"login":"WFPhantom","id":89593443,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTkzNDQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89593443?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WFPhantom","html_url":"https://github.com/WFPhantom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u