n":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I just recently did the JEI Plugin for IC2Classic... And it was easier & harder then i through.\nGood work mate. Its way more modular now. And the caching of recipes is a good idea.\nBut 1 feature is sadly not really possible with JEI which i kinda wish that would be possible.\nThe option that you could hide Recipe Entries. Without forcing the player to reload resource locations when they unhide them. (Not via JEI more via the mod who adds them)\nI made a semi hidden recipe at the moment where i just show the output and not the input but i am not really happy about that idea.\nSo a question? Is it possible to hide recipes without making them invalid?\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/534/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/3477","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/3477/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/3477/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/3477/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/issues/3477","id":2221664017,"node_id":"I_kwDOAXhAOc6Ea-cR","number":3477,"title":"[Crash/LongLoadingTime]: jei:forge_gui","user":{"login":"zaryar","id":46141276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTQxMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46141276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaryar","